                    "answer": "<div style='background-color:#f0fdf4; padding:15px; border-left:5px solid #16a34a; border-radius:8px;'><h4 style='color:#14532d; margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:18px;'>&#10004; ઉકેલ:</h4><div style='background-color:#ffffff; padding:15px; border-radius:5px; border:1px solid #bbf7d0;'><p style='margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>કુલ સમય = 24 કલાક. પહેલા આપણે દરેક પ્રવૃત્તિ માટે કેન્દ્ર પાસેનો ખૂણો શોધીશું:</p><div style='overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 15px;'><table style='width: 100%; min-width: 400px; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;'><tr style='background-color: #e2e8f0;'><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>પ્રવૃત્તિ</th><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>સમય (કલાક)</th><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>અપૂર્ણાંક</th><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>કેન્દ્ર પાસેનો ખૂણો</th></tr><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>ઊંઘ</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>8</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>8/24 = 1/3</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>(1/3) &times; 360&deg; = <b>120&deg;</b></td></tr><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>શાળા</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>6</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>6/24 = 1/4</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>(1/4) &times; 360&deg; = <b>90&deg;</b></td></tr><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>ગૃહકાર્ય</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>4</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>4/24 = 1/6</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>(1/6) &times; 360&deg; = <b>60&deg;</b></td></tr><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>રમત</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>4</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>4/24 = 1/6</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>(1/6) &times; 360&deg; = <b>60&deg;</b></td></tr><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>અન્ય</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>2</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>2/24 = 1/12</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>(1/12) &times; 360&deg; = <b>30&deg;</b></td></tr></table></div><p style='margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'><b>માહિતીનો પાઇ ચાર્ટ (વર્તુળ આલેખ):</b></p><div style='overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 10px;'><div style='display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; min-width: 250px;'><div style='width: 200px; height: 200px; border-radius: 50%; background: conic-gradient(#ef4444 0% 33.33%, #3b82f6 33.33% 58.33%, #10b981 58.33% 75%, #f59e0b 75% 91.67%, #8b5cf6 91.67% 100%); box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); flex-shrink: 0; border: 2px solid #fff;'></div><div style='display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px;'><div style='display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;'><span style='width:15px; height:15px; background:#ef4444; border-radius:3px;'></span> ઊંઘ (120&deg;)</div><div style='display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;'><span style='width:15px; height:15px; background:#3b82f6; border-radius:3px;'></span> શાળા (90&deg;)</div><div style='display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;'><span style='width:15px; height:15px; background:#10b981; border-radius:3px;'></span> ગૃહકાર્ય (60&deg;)</div><div style='display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;'><span style='width:15px; height:15px; background:#f59e0b; border-radius:3px;'></span> રમત (60&deg;)</div><div style='display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;'><span style='width:15px; height:15px; background:#8b5cf6; border-radius:3px;'></span> અન્ય (30&deg;)</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
