                    "answer": "<div style='background-color:#f0fdf4; padding:15px; border-left:5px solid #16a34a; border-radius:8px;'><h4 style='color:#14532d; margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:18px;'>&#10004; ઉકેલ:</h4><div style='background-color:#ffffff; padding:15px; border-radius:5px; border:1px solid #bbf7d0;'><p style='margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>કુલ લોકોની સંખ્યા = 360. કેન્દ્ર પાસેનો ખૂણો નીચે મુજબ ગણી શકાય:</p><div style='overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 15px;'><table style='width: 100%; min-width: 400px; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;'><tr style='background-color: #e2e8f0;'><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>ઋતુ</th><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>મતની સંખ્યા</th><th style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>કેન્દ્ર પાસેનો ખૂણો</th></tr><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>ઉનાળો</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>90</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>(90/360) &times; 360&deg; = <b>90&deg;</b></td></tr><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>ચોમાસું</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>120</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>(120/360) &times; 360&deg; = <b>120&deg;</b></td></tr><tr><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>શિયાળો</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>150</td><td style='border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px;'>(150/360) &times; 360&deg; = <b>150&deg;</b></td></tr></table></div><p style='margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'><b>માહિતીનો પાઇ ચાર્ટ:</b></p><div style='overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 10px;'><div style='display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; min-width: 250px;'><div style='width: 200px; height: 200px; border-radius: 50%; background: conic-gradient(#fde047 0% 25%, #60a5fa 25% 58.33%, #9ca3af 58.33% 100%); box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); flex-shrink: 0; border: 2px solid #fff;'></div><div style='display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px;'><div style='display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;'><span style='width:15px; height:15px; background:#fde047; border-radius:3px;'></span> ઉનાળો (90&deg;)</div><div style='display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;'><span style='width:15px; height:15px; background:#60a5fa; border-radius:3px;'></span> ચોમાસું (120&deg;)</div><div style='display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;'><span style='width:15px; height:15px; background:#9ca3af; border-radius:3px;'></span> શિયાળો (150&deg;)</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
